            sixgr.util.structGet(out, ...
            "SSSINRNoiseInterferencePowerPerReceiveAntenna_W", ""));
        r.SSSINRDesiredPowerPerReceiveAntenna_W = string(sixgr.util.structGet( ...
            out, "SSSINRDesiredPowerPerReceiveAntenna_W", ""));
